/// Sam Rivera, a product designer at Lumen. Sam also runs a design studio on
/// the side, rents a flat in San Francisco, and rents out a condo bought in
/// 2024.
///
/// This is a sketch of the v4 surface, not yet runnable. It shows what the
/// journal says and, after `▸`, what Axiom infers or derives from it, as an
/// editor would show it in hints. Nothing after a `▸` is ever typed.
base USD
use us/ca/san-francisco
use us/rental
use us/401k
use us/securities

entity me : person
  born   1990-04-12
  filing single
  lives  us/ca/san-francisco

/// The side business. Its income and costs are its own, and they reach Sam's
/// return on Schedule C.
entity studio : sole-proprietorship
  owner me
